{
  "$comment": "Golden care vectors (docs/CARE_MODULES_PLAN.md, Phase 3: 'Parity vectors green on both sides'). Inputs -> the due time of the walks module (lib/care/modules/walks.ts predictWalk) and the habitat module (lib/care/modules/habitat.ts habitatDue). Consumed by lib/__tests__/careVectors.test.ts (client) and by scripts/gen-care-parity-sql.js, which writes the generated block of supabase/tests/012_care_pushes.sql (server, app.recompute_care in 0022). All instants are absolute: neither due time depends on now(), so the SQL replays them exactly; `now` only decides overdueBy on the client. Habitat vectors always set habitatIntervalDays: a null interval resolves to the species default on the client but produces no server row (see 0022's header).",
  "version": 1,
  "vectors": [
    {
      "id": "w01_default_interval",
